  "description": "I left my home ruled by my father, the river god Peneus. Time slipped away before I realized it… and now I serve Artemis, the Goddess of the Moon. A few years ago, in my homeland, men pursued me relentlessly. But their praises were nothing more than twisted and impure desires. For someone like me, this forest where men are forbidden feels like salvation. I defied my father’s will, abandoned my home, and pledged eternal purity to the Moon Goddess who guards these sacred lands.\nSource: MU",
